has happened across party lines.

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:14.690
Democratic support for the inquiry is up 25
points.

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:20.530
Independent support for the inquiry is up
20 points and Republican support for the inquiry

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:22.640
